##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub #205: focusfactor is an attribute: the left polygon is in a block that sets 0.5, the right one is not.
# test_dof_shading_rate counts the vertices the rasterizer shades, from the end-of-frame statistics.
version 3.03
Hider "reyes"
Display "dof-shading-rate-scoped-reyes.tif" "file" "rgb"
Format 200 150 1
PixelSamples 1 1
ShadingRate 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 45
DepthOfField 2 1 2
Translate 0 0 10
WorldBegin
  AttributeBegin
    GeometricApproximation "focusfactor" 0.5
    Polygon "P" [-5 -3 0  0 -3 0  0 3 0  -5 3 0]
  AttributeEnd
  Polygon "P" [0 -3 0  5 -3 0  5 3 0  0 3 0]
WorldEnd
